# Only experiment sources, build inputs, and READMEs are versioned.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README*
!*.c
!*.cc
!*.cpp
!*.cu
!*.cuh
!*.h
!*.hpp
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.bt
!*.bt.in
!Makefile
!CMakeLists.txt
!requirements*.txt
# Generated output directories and generated tracing programs stay local.
**/trace/
**/baseline/
**/results/
**/artifacts/
**/logs/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.generated.*
